# Prettier formats code, not prose.
#
# The Markdown here is documents of record — the SRS, the ADRs (immutable once
# accepted), the agent definitions. Prettier pads Markdown table columns to
# align them, which turns a one-cell edit into a whole-table diff and churns
# files whose git history is supposed to mean something. It buys nothing:
# these are read on GitHub and in editors that render them.
#
# Remove an entry here only if you want that tree auto-formatted.
